  "wcf7f4e16": "Runestone draws its windows, buttons and chat parchment from a resource pack: pixel art that players of the game it is modelled on have made for it. It comes with Duckscape, fetched to this device from the packs' own hub on GitHub the first time the look is used; choose another, or plain stone, here. A pack is its artist's own work and is not part of this app.",
